.ipynb_checkpoints/
# The root Manifest is committed on purpose: it is the only place the unregistered
# GBGPeriodicFields git URL + pinned commit are recorded, so it must travel with the
# repo for a fresh clone / CI to resolve the dependency. Nested env Manifests stay ignored.
Manifest.toml
!/Manifest.toml
docs/build/
docs/site/

# Local-only reference material (theses, papers, notes) — never committed
inspiration/
